# Locally built binaries. `make build` writes cmd/mgit/mgit; CLAUDE.md's
# verification checklist writes build/mgit. They are ~21 MB each, and mgit's
# store is append-only, so one swept in by `mgit commit -a` — the instructed way
# to commit — sits in the branch's objects forever. That has happened twice
# (MGIT-131): a 40 MB binary in task/MGIT-121.1, a 21 MB one in task/MGIT-123.
cmd/mgit/mgit
/mgit
/mgit-sandboxd
/mgit-guest
/mgit.exe

# Build output directory. Everything under build/ is output EXCEPT the darwin
# code-signing inputs the Makefile reads (`codesign --entitlements
# build/darwin/vz.entitlements`), which are source and must stay tracked. The
# directory itself is never excluded, only its contents, so git still descends
# into build/darwin to see the re-included files below.
/build/*
!/build/darwin/
/build/darwin/*
!/build/darwin/README.md
!/build/darwin/vz.entitlements

# Compiled test binaries from `go test -c` (Makefile: e2e-libkrun), which land
# in the package directory when -o is omitted.
*.test

CONCURRENCY-ANALYSIS.md
SECURITY-AUDIT-LOCK.md
AUDIT-*.md
# FR-17 audits are normative anchors for FR-17.24-17.37 and ADR-005
# acceptance, and are read by TestTrace_* — they must be tracked.
!AUDIT-FR17-SANDBOX-V1.md
!AUDIT-FR17-SANDBOX-SECURITY-V1.md
FR-MTIX-*.md

cover.out
coverage.out

dist/

# Local dev/infra notes — contain internal network details (LAN IPs,
# hostnames, SSH key names, dev-box paths). MUST NOT be committed/pushed.
FR17-SANDBOX-HANDOFF.md
*-tasks.json
import-to-mtix.py

# Guest VM images + other large local test fixtures (downloaded per-host)
.testdata/

# mgit's own self-contained store when dogfooding mgit on this repo. mgit
# coexists with the project's git repo (MGIT-14) and its store must never be
# committed to git — it is local, per-checkout state.
.mgit/

# mtix runtime artifacts (not portable)
.mtix/data/*.db
.mtix/data/*.db-shm
.mtix/data/*.db-wal
.mtix/data/*.lock
.mtix/data/*.sha256
# mtix rotates timestamped snapshots here; they are machine-local runtime
# state, not source, and a tracked one goes stale the moment it rotates.
.mtix/data/backups/
.mtix/logs/
/mcpdrive
